# Cookie Information

> Cookie Information is an EU-based consent management platform for websites and apps. It helps organizations collect and manage user consent, scan and classify cookies, maintain audit-ready consent records, implement Google Consent Mode v2, and comply with privacy requirements such as GDPR and ePrivacy. Cookie Information also offers a Business plan that combines its cookie consent management platform with privacy-first analytics powered by Piwik PRO.

