## Core capabilities

### Consent management

Cookie Information helps websites and apps:

- Collect and manage valid user consent
- Block non-essential cookies until consent is given
- Scan websites for cookies and trackers
- Automatically classify detected cookies
- Maintain an up-to-date cookie policy
- Store consent records for compliance and audits
- Let users review or change consent choices
- Customize banner design, text, language, and behaviour

Primary page:
- [Cookie Consent Management Platform](https://cookieinformation.com/consent-management-platform/)

### Google Consent Mode v2

Cookie Information is a Google CMP Gold Partner and supports native Google Consent Mode v2 implementation.

Useful documentation:
- [Cookie Information Support](https://support.cookieinformation.com/)
